From 212e099da28081592bae3558b7052658b528631f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Nguyen <the.nguyen.yf@renesas.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 07:13:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] [noup] Tests: crypto: Add ML-DSA-87 KeyGen KAT and
 sign/verify test

Add the TFM_CRYPTO_TEST_MLDSA_87 option (OFF by default) and a common
test helper, tfm_crypto_test_mldsa87_sign_verify(), shared by the
secure and non-secure crypto suites.

The helper checks ML-DSA-87 key generation against a NIST FIPS 204
KeyGen KAT vector. It then imports the key, exports the public key,
and runs PSA sign/verify.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: The Nguyen <the.nguyen.yf@renesas.com>
---
